  "description": "Task 162 M0 bench cells: ec_distann parity A/B vs rabitq ec_diskann at 10k/50k (FR-075-AC-4), D7 neighbor-code codec comparison (grouped_pq/rabitq/turboquant), NFR-018 storage ratios, and D3 head_index_cap sensitivity (FR-080-AC-4). Bespoke config: ec_distann is not yet in the canonical lane sweep (EC_DISTANN profile lands with this packet; canonical inclusion is Task-007/M4). Per-variant table isolation via distinct prefixes. Sweep semantics: the profile sweep drives ec_distann.top_k (the D9 early-exit bar, the list_size analog); hop_rounds stays the NFR-019 cap. The distann_tq arms at default R=32 fail by design (record exceeds page capacity -- the D1 finding); distann_tq_r8 arms measure turboquant at graph_degree=8 informationally. Protocol: recall step precedes latency step per arm (task-168 packet 004 first-point trap).",
